    "turn_text": "Yeah, so leave the iguanas alone. Right. Important lesson. All right. Well, we'll get into the bigger news outside of iguanas. You know, Senator, we're coming up on the anniversary of Roe versus Wade. You know, I watched, I rewatched your CNN interview on abortion. I think it was from like eight years ago. before this morning, before interviewing you. I think it was one of the best interviews I've seen from a Republican to date on the issue. Why do you think Republicans struggle so much on talking about pro-life and talking about this issue?",
