  {
    "episode_id": 94819,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/4/94819.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 70,
    "turn_text": "You know, I agree with what you just said and the way you laid it out with the message there. And I think we went on the messaging. My concern is the mechanics and, you know, elections have really changed since COVID with mail-in balloting, ballot harvesting. Do you think, do you think we're doing enough at, you know, the RNC at the NRCC at the NRCC to combat the Democrats mechanics of, you know, getting ballots turned in?",
